q11 as (insert into public.quiz_questions (quiz_id, question_text, question_type, sort_order) select id, $qz$A team wants to log in once via the API and reuse the token for a batch of API tests. Which setup fits Playwright’s model best?$qz$, 'multiple_choice', 11 from newq returning id),
